## Parsea `antiquus ...:` + cuerpo C.
##
## ## Memoria
## Crea un nodo `antiquus_decl` con el token del cuerpo.
weave pdecl_parse_antiquus with p as ref to PsParser, attrs as int into int:
    var start as int is calling ps_current_start with p
    calling ps_begin_children with p
    calling ps_add_child with p, attrs
    calling pdecl_parse_modifiers_into with p
    var ignored as Token is calling ps_expect_kw with p, KwAntiquus, "'antiquus'"
    calling pdecl_parse_modifiers_into with p
    calling pdecl_add_name_token with p
    if calling ps_check_kw with p, KwShard:
        calling ps_add_child with p, (calling ptypes.ptype_parse_shard_params with p)
    else:
        calling ps_add_absent with p
    if calling ps_check_kw with p, KwWith:
        calling ps_add_child with p, (calling pdecl_parse_param_list with p)
    else:
        calling ps_add_absent with p
    if calling ps_check_kw with p, KwInto:
        var ignored2 as Token is calling ps_advance with p
        var ty as int is calling ptypes.ptype_parse_type with p
        calling ps_add_child with p, ty
    else:
        calling ps_add_absent with p
    var ignored3 as Token is calling ps_expect with p, TokColon, "':'"
    var ignored4 as Token is calling ps_expect with p, TokNewline, "newline"
    var ignored5 as Token is calling ps_expect with p, TokIndent, "indent"
    if calling ps_check with p, TokAntiquusBody:
        calling ps_add_token with p, p->pos
        var ignored6 as Token is calling ps_advance with p
    else:
        calling ps_emit_here with p, pdiag.ParseIssue.ParseExpectedToken, "antiquus body"
        calling ps_add_absent with p
    if calling ps_check with p, TokNewline:
        var ignored7 as Token is calling ps_advance with p
    if calling ps_check with p, TokDedent:
        var ignored8 as Token is calling ps_advance with p
    else:
        calling ps_emit_here with p, pdiag.ParseIssue.ParseExpectedDedent, ""
    return calling ps_finish_node with p, NodeKind.NdAntiquusDecl, start, (calling ps_previous_end with p), 0

