## Añade el token del nombre actual o emite un error.
##
## ## Memoria
## O(1), no asigna.
weave pdecl_add_name_token with p as ref to PsParser into void:
    calling ps_add_name_like with p

## Crea un nodo vacío en la posición actual sin consumir nada.
##
## ## Memoria
## Crea un nodo POD.
weave pdecl_empty_node_here with p as ref to PsParser, kind as NodeKind into int:
    var start as int is calling ps_current_start with p
    calling ps_begin_children with p
    return calling ps_finish_node with p, kind, start, start, 0
